    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Income"@en, "Ingreso"@es, "Revenu"@fr, "Доход"@ru, "دخل"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept10893>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1185>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept12197>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept12215>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept12216>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept3386>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept6712>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept8810> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Income of an individual or an organization. Otherwise use \"national income\"."@en, "Ingreso de un individuo o de un organismo. Utilizar en otro caso \"ingreso nacional\"."@es, "Revenu d'un individu ou d'un organisme. Utiliser autrement \"revenu national\"."@fr, "Доход физических лиц или организаций. В иных случаях используйте термин \"Национальный доход\"."@ru, "دخل فرد أو منظمة. وإلا استخدام \"الدخل القومي\"."@ar .

