    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept2842>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept2847>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept7803> ;
