    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cultural interaction"@en, "Interacción cultural"@es, "Interaction culturelle"@fr, "Культурное взаимодействие"@ru, "تفاعل ثقافي"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1194>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept256>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept3897>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept5941>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept6998>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept7007> ;
