    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Beaux-arts"@fr, "Bellas artes"@es, "Fine arts"@en, "Изобразительное искусство"@ru, "فنون جميلة"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1587>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept2951>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept341>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept343>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept346>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept347> ;
