    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Avantage comparé"@fr, "Avantage relatif"@fr, "Ventaja relativa"@es, "ميزة المقارنة"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept584> ;
