    a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Ciencia jurídica"@es, "Legal sciences"@en, "Science juridique"@fr, "Юридические науки"@ru, "علوم قانونية"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus> ;
