    a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cultura académica"@es, "Cultura técnica"@es, "Culture technique"@fr, "Technical culture"@en, "Культура техники"@ru, "ثقافة تقنية"@ar ;
