    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1000>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept996>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept997>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept998>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept999> .

<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept996>
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2019-12-15T14:00:11Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;
    a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "قدرات"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept389> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept999> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aptitud"@es, "Aptitude"@en, "Aptitude"@fr, "Склонность"@ru, "استعداد"@ar ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept1000>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept2611>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept993>, <http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept998> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Capacidad potencial de un individuo de desempeñar una tarea en la que carece de experiencia."@es, "Capacité potentielle d'un individu à remplir une tâche dont il n'a pas encore l'expérience."@fr, "The potential ability of an individual to perform an as yet unlearned task or skill."@en, "Потенциальная способность человека выполнять до сих пор не изученную задачу или работу."@ru, "قدرة الفرد المحتملة على أداء مهمة أو مهارة لم يكتسبها من قبل."@ar .

<http://vocabularies.unesco.org/thesaurus/concept997>
